Dear Editors,

Please consider our attached manuscript, "Regional medullary redox indices an=
d Nox1/Nox4 mRNA expression in rats with atlantoaxial joint disorder", as an =
Short Communication in Physiological Research.

The study reports exploratory regional biochemical and transcript observation=
s. Its sampling-time differences, assay-validation limitations and animal-car=
e limitations are disclosed in the manuscript and cover letter. Related publi=
shed work and the shared blood-pressure observations are also identified.

All authors have approved the manuscript. The manuscript has not been publish=
ed previously and is not under consideration elsewhere. The authors declare n=
o competing interests.

We provide the editable short manuscript and complete PDF, two separate main =
figures, cover letter, supplementary information containing detailed methods,=
 extended results and editable Supplementary Table S1, and available numerica=
l inputs, source archives and reproducible code. Please advise if supplementa=
ry items require an alternative format or placement.

Thank you for considering our submission.

Sincerely,
Zijian Wu and Youkui Lv
Corresponding authors, on behalf of all authors
wuzijian@ahtcm.edu.cn; lvyk126@126.com

